📦 Key Architectural & Production-Grade Features Implemented
1. Foundation & Cross-Cutting Infrastructure
Granular RBAC + PBAC: Defined role hierarchy (SUPER_ADMIN > ADMIN > SUPPORT_AGENT / SUPPORT > OPERATOR_AGENT > CUSTOMER) in 

src/modules/admin/admin.permissions.ts
 and middleware in 

src/modules/admin/admin.middleware.ts
.
Non-blocking Audit Logging: 

adminAudit()
 records every mutation (POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE) asynchronously to the AdminActivityLog table with automatic sanitization of sensitive fields (password, token, secret, cardNumber).
Prisma Schema Enhancement: Added models Operator, Coupon, CouponUsage, SupportTicket, SupportTicketReply, SystemConfig, FeatureFlag, AdminActivityLog and their associated enums in 

prisma/schema.prisma
.
Streaming CSV Export: Integrated 

sendCsvResponse()
 utility for memory-efficient streaming of large datasets with RFC 4180 escaping and UTF-8 BOM.
Resilient Error Hierarchy: Extended 

src/shared/errors/index.ts
 with BadRequestError, AdminActionDeniedError, InvalidConfigError, and InvalidStateTransitionError.
